             ,HELPFUL HINTS

,FOR EVERYONE3 ,FIRST LOOK AT THE BIG
  ANIMAL1 THEN AT ITS BABY4 ,ASK
  YOURSELF3 DO THEY LOOK ALIKE8
,VISION3 ,A FROG'S BABY HAS NO LEGS AND
  HAS A LONG TAIL4 ,A BUTTERFLY'S BABY
  IS A CATERPILLAR1 WHICH HAS NO WINGS4
  ,MAKE BOTH SHAPES FROM CLAY OR DOUGH
  AND FEEL THE DIFFERENCE WITH YOUR
  HANDS4
,UNDERSTANDING3 ,LOOK AT ONLY ONE PAIR
  AT A TIME4 ,SAY3 8CAT1 KITTEN,71 8HEN1
  CHICK,74 ,MAKE THE ANIMAL'S SOUND AS
  WELL4
,FOR TEACHERS3 ,GIVE CLASS PICTURE CARDS
  TO CHILDREN WHO CANNOT BRING A
  PICTURE1 OR LET THEM DRAW ONE4
  ,CHILDREN CAN TAKE PART BY SPEAKING1
  BY USING GESTURES OR BY MATCHING
  CARDS4

